  "prompt": "<p class=\"review-context\">Reading a patching result</p><p>The logit difference is 3.2 on the clean input and <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span> on the corrupted one. Patching one head gives 2.0, a restored fraction of <span class=\"blank\" data-blank=\"0\">[ 1 ]</span>.</p>",
